# Feature Requirements

## Version: 1.0.0
Last Updated: 2025-01-28

---

## Feature: Button Component
Priority: High
Status: Pending

### Overview
A flexible, accessible button component that serves as the foundation of the component library. Supports multiple variants, sizes, states, and configurations using the project's design token system.

### Requirements

#### 1. Basic Button
- Render a clickable button element
- Support text content
- Handle click events
- Use semantic HTML `<button>` element
- Apply base BEM class: `.aceui-button`
- Use design tokens from `design-tokens.css`

#### 2. Disabled State
- Support `isDisabled` prop (boolean)
- Visual indication of disabled state using `--disabled-opacity: 0.5`
- Prevent click events when disabled
- Apply modifier class: `.aceui-button--disabled`
- Add `disabled` attribute to button element (do not add `aria-disabled`; native `<button>` uses `disabled` only per a11y guidelines)
- Change cursor to `not-allowed`

#### 3. Sizes
Support three size variants via `size` prop:

- **Small**: `.aceui-button--small`
  - Font size: `var(--font-size-small)` (0.875rem / 14px)
  - Line height: `var(--line-height-small)` (1.25rem)
  - Padding: 0 12px
  - Min-height: 32px
  
- **Medium** (default): `.aceui-button--medium`
  - Font size: `var(--font-size-medium)` (1rem / 16px)
  - Line height: `var(--line-height-medium)` (1.5rem)
  - Padding: 0 16px
  - Min-height: 40px
  
- **Large**: `.aceui-button--large`
  - Font size: `var(--font-size-large)` (1.125rem / 18px)
  - Line height: `var(--line-height-large)` (1.75rem)
  - Padding: 0 24px
  - Min-height: 48px

#### 4. Border Radius
Support radius variants via `radius` prop using design tokens:

- **Small**: `.aceui-button--radius-small`
  - Border radius: `var(--radius-small)` (8px)
  
- **Medium** (default): `.aceui-button--radius-medium`
  - Border radius: `var(--radius-medium)` (12px)
  
- **Large**: `.aceui-button--radius-large`
  - Border radius: `var(--radius-large)` (14px)
  
- **Full**: `.aceui-button--radius-full`
  - Border radius: `9999px` (pill shape)

#### 5. Colors
Support color variants via `color` prop using design token color system:

- **Default**: Uses `--color-default` system
  - Base: `var(--color-default-500)`
  - Foreground: `var(--color-default-foreground)`
  - Hover: `var(--color-default-600)`
  - Active: `var(--color-default-700)`
  
- **Primary** (default): Uses `--color-primary` system
  - Base: `var(--color-primary-500)` (#006fee)
  - Foreground: `var(--color-primary-foreground)` (#fff)
  - Hover: `var(--color-primary-600)`
  - Active: `var(--color-primary-700)`
  
- **Secondary**: Uses `--color-secondary` system
  - Base: `var(--color-secondary-500)` (#7828c8)
  - Foreground: `var(--color-secondary-foreground)` (#fff)
  - Hover: `var(--color-secondary-600)`
  - Active: `var(--color-secondary-700)`
  
- **Success**: Uses `--color-success` system
  - Base: `var(--color-success-500)` (#17c964)
  - Foreground: `var(--color-success-foreground)` (#000)
  - Hover: `var(--color-success-600)`
  - Active: `var(--color-success-700)`
  
- **Warning**: Uses `--color-warning` system
  - Base: `var(--color-warning-500)` (#f5a524)
  - Foreground: `var(--color-warning-foreground)` (#000)
  - Hover: `var(--color-warning-600)`
  - Active: `var(--color-warning-700)`
  
- **Danger**: Uses `--color-danger` system
  - Base: `var(--color-danger-500)` (#f31260)
  - Foreground: `var(--color-danger-foreground)` (#000)
  - Hover: `var(--color-danger-600)`
  - Active: `var(--color-danger-700)`

Apply as: `.aceui-button--color-default`, `.aceui-button--color-primary`, `.aceui-button--color-danger`, etc.

#### 6. Variants
Support style variants via `variant` prop:

- **Solid** (default): `.aceui-button--solid`
  - Background: Color token (e.g., `var(--color-primary-500)`)
  - Text: Color foreground token (e.g., `var(--color-primary-foreground)`)
  - Border: None
  - Hover: Darker shade from color system (e.g., `var(--color-primary-600)`)
  
- **Bordered**: `.aceui-button--bordered`
  - Background: Transparent
  - Border: `var(--border-width-medium)` solid color (e.g., `var(--color-primary-500)`)
  - Text: Color token (e.g., `var(--color-primary-500)`)
  - Hover: Light background tint using color-50 (e.g., `var(--color-primary-50)`)
  
- **Light**: `.aceui-button--light`
  - Background: Light shade (e.g., `var(--color-primary-50)`)
  - Text: Color token (e.g., `var(--color-primary-500)`)
  - Border: None
  - Hover: Slightly darker light shade (e.g., `var(--color-primary-100)`)
  
- **Flat**: `.aceui-button--flat`
  - Background: Transparent
  - Text: Color token (e.g., `var(--color-primary-500)`)
  - Border: None
  - Hover: Light background using `--hover-opacity` overlay (rgba with 0.1 opacity)
  
- **Shadow**: `.aceui-button--shadow`
  - Same as solid variant
  - Add box shadow: `var(--box-shadow-small)` or `var(--box-shadow-medium)` based on size
  - Hover: Increase shadow to next level
  - Active: Reduce shadow

- **Ghost**: `.aceui-button--ghost`
  - Background: Transparent
  - Border: `var(--border-width-small)` solid with low opacity
  - Text: Color token
  - Hover: Border becomes solid, light background tint

#### 7. Loading State
- Support `isLoading` prop (boolean)
- Show loading spinner icon
- Disable button interaction during loading
- Apply modifier class: `.aceui-button--loading`
- Add `.aceui-button__spinner` element
- Maintain button text or show `loadingText` prop if provided
- Maintain button width to prevent layout shift
- Add `aria-busy="true"` attribute
- Reduce opacity using `var(--disabled-opacity)`

#### 8. With Icon
Support icons via `icon` and `iconPosition` props:

- **Icon Element**: 
  - Accept icon as prop (React node)
  - Create `.aceui-button__icon` element for styling
  
- **Icon Position**: via `iconPosition` prop
  - `left` (default): Icon before text
  - `right`: Icon after text
  
- **Icon Only**: 
  - When no children/text provided
  - Apply `.aceui-button--icon-only` modifier
  - Make button square (equal width/height)
  - Center icon
  
- **Spacing**:
  - Gap between icon and text: 0.5rem
  - Adjust icon size based on button size:
    - Small: 1rem (16px)
    - Medium: 1.25rem (20px)
    - Large: 1.5rem (24px)

### Component API
```typescript
interface ButtonProps {
  // Content
  children?: React.ReactNode;
  
  // Variants
  variant?: 'solid' | 'bordered' | 'light' | 'flat' | 'shadow' | 'ghost';
  color?: 'default' | 'primary' | 'secondary' | 'success' | 'warning' | 'danger';
  size?: 'small' | 'medium' | 'large';
  radius?: 'small' | 'medium' | 'large' | 'full';
  
  // States
  isDisabled?: boolean;
  isLoading?: boolean;
  
  // Icon
  icon?: React.ReactNode;
  iconPosition?: 'left' | 'right';
  
  // Loading
  loadingText?: string;
  
  // Events
  onClick?: (event: React.MouseEvent<HTMLButtonElement>) => void;
  
  // Accessibility
  ariaLabel?: string;
  
  // HTML attributes
  type?: 'button' | 'submit' | 'reset';
  className?: string;
  testId?: string;
}
```

### BEM Class Structure
```css
/* Base */
.aceui-button

/* Elements */
.aceui-button__icon
.aceui-button__spinner
.aceui-button__text

/* Modifiers - Variants */
.aceui-button--solid
.aceui-button--bordered
.aceui-button--light
.aceui-button--flat
.aceui-button--shadow
.aceui-button--ghost

/* Modifiers - Colors */
.aceui-button--color-default
.aceui-button--color-primary
.aceui-button--color-secondary
.aceui-button--color-success
.aceui-button--color-warning
.aceui-button--color-danger

/* Modifiers - Sizes */
.aceui-button--small
.aceui-button--medium
.aceui-button--large

/* Modifiers - Radius */
.aceui-button--radius-small
.aceui-button--radius-medium
.aceui-button--radius-large
.aceui-button--radius-full

/* Modifiers - States */
.aceui-button--disabled
.aceui-button--loading
.aceui-button--icon-only
```

### CSS Implementation Guide

Use design tokens for all styling:
```css
/* Example: Primary Solid Button */
.aceui-button.aceui-button--solid.aceui-button--color-primary {
  background-color: var(--color-primary-500);
  color: var(--color-primary-foreground);
  border: none;
}

.aceui-button.aceui-button--solid.aceui-button--color-primary:hover:not(:disabled) {
  background-color: var(--color-primary-600);
}

.aceui-button.aceui-button--solid.aceui-button--color-primary:active:not(:disabled) {
  background-color: var(--color-primary-700);
}

/* Example: Bordered Variant */
.aceui-button.aceui-button--bordered.aceui-button--color-primary {
  background-color: transparent;
  color: var(--color-primary-500);
  border: var(--border-width-medium) solid var(--color-primary-500);
}

.aceui-button.aceui-button--bordered.aceui-button--color-primary:hover:not(:disabled) {
  background-color: var(--color-primary-50);
}

/* Example: Light Variant */
.aceui-button.aceui-button--light.aceui-button--color-primary {
  background-color: var(--color-primary-50);
  color: var(--color-primary-500);
  border: none;
}

.aceui-button.aceui-button--light.aceui-button--color-primary:hover:not(:disabled) {
  background-color: var(--color-primary-100);
}

/* Example: Flat Variant with hover opacity */
.aceui-button.aceui-button--flat.aceui-button--color-primary {
  background-color: transparent;
  color: var(--color-primary-500);
  border: none;
}

.aceui-button.aceui-button--flat.aceui-button--color-primary:hover:not(:disabled) {
  background-color: rgba(0, 111, 238, var(--hover-opacity)); /* primary with hover opacity */
}

/* Sizes */
.aceui-button.aceui-button--small {
  font-size: var(--font-size-small);
  line-height: var(--line-height-small);
  padding: 0 12px;
  min-height: 32px;
}

.aceui-button.aceui-button--medium {
  font-size: var(--font-size-medium);
  line-height: var(--line-height-medium);
  padding: 0 16px;
  min-height: 40px;
}

.aceui-button.aceui-button--large {
  font-size: var(--font-size-large);
  line-height: var(--line-height-large);
  padding: 0 24px;
  min-height: 48px;
}

/* Radius */
.aceui-button.aceui-button--radius-small {
  border-radius: var(--radius-small);
}

.aceui-button.aceui-button--radius-medium {
  border-radius: var(--radius-medium);
}

.aceui-button.aceui-button--radius-large {
  border-radius: var(--radius-large);
}

.aceui-button.aceui-button--radius-full {
  border-radius: 9999px;
}

/* Shadow variant */
.aceui-button.aceui-button--shadow {
  box-shadow: var(--box-shadow-small);
}

.aceui-button.aceui-button--shadow.aceui-button--large {
  box-shadow: var(--box-shadow-medium);
}

.aceui-button.aceui-button--shadow:hover:not(:disabled) {
  box-shadow: var(--box-shadow-medium);
}

/* Disabled state */
.aceui-button:disabled,
.aceui-button.aceui-button--disabled {
  opacity: var(--disabled-opacity);
  cursor: not-allowed;
  pointer-events: none;
}

/* Loading state */
.aceui-button.aceui-button--loading {
  opacity: var(--disabled-opacity);
  cursor: not-allowed;
}

/* Focus state */
.aceui-button:focus-visible {
  outline: 2px solid var(--color-focus);
  outline-offset: 2px;
}
```

### Acceptance Criteria

#### Functionality
- [ ] Button renders with default props (solid, primary, medium, radius-medium)
- [ ] All size variants render correctly using design token font sizes
- [ ] All 6 color variants render correctly using design token colors
- [ ] All 6 style variants (solid, bordered, light, flat, shadow, ghost) work
- [ ] All radius variants apply correct design token values
- [ ] Disabled state prevents clicks and uses `--disabled-opacity`
- [ ] Loading state shows spinner and uses `--disabled-opacity`
- [ ] Icon renders in correct position
- [ ] Icon-only button is square
- [ ] Click handler fires correctly
- [ ] Hover opacity uses `--hover-opacity` for flat variant

#### Design Token Integration
- [ ] All colors use design token CSS variables
- [ ] All font sizes use design token variables
- [ ] All line heights use design token variables
- [ ] All border radius use design token variables
- [ ] All border widths use design token variables
- [ ] All box shadows use design token variables
- [ ] Disabled opacity uses `--disabled-opacity`
- [ ] Hover opacity uses `--hover-opacity`
- [ ] Focus outline uses `--color-focus`
- [ ] Background uses `--color-background` where applicable
- [ ] Foreground uses `--color-foreground` where applicable

#### Accessibility
- [ ] Uses semantic `<button>` element
- [ ] Keyboard accessible (Enter and Space to activate)
- [ ] Focus visible using `--color-focus`
- [ ] `disabled` attribute when disabled (no redundant `aria-disabled` for native button)
- [ ] `aria-busy` when loading
- [ ] `aria-label` supported
- [ ] Screen reader announces button state
- [ ] Color contrast meets WCAG AA standards (4.5:1)

#### Styling
- [ ] BEM naming convention followed
- [ ] Regular CSS used (`.css` file)
- [ ] No style conflicts
- [ ] Hover states work on all variants using design tokens
- [ ] Active states work on all variants using design tokens
- [ ] Focus states visible using `--color-focus`
- [ ] Smooth transitions (200-300ms)
- [ ] Loading spinner animated
- [ ] Shadow variant uses correct box-shadow tokens
- [ ] All color shades (50-900) work correctly

#### Combinations
- [ ] All 6 variants × 6 colors = 36 combinations work
- [ ] All variants × 3 sizes work
- [ ] All variants × 4 radius options work
- [ ] Disabled + loading states handled
- [ ] Icon + loading states handled
- [ ] Shadow + all colors work correctly

#### Testing
- [ ] Unit tests for all props
- [ ] Tests for click handler
- [ ] Tests for disabled state
- [ ] Tests for loading state
- [ ] Tests for icon rendering
- [ ] Tests for all color variants
- [ ] Tests for all style variants
- [ ] Tests for design token usage
- [ ] Accessibility tests pass
- [ ] Test coverage ≥ 80%

#### Documentation
- [ ] JSDoc comments on component
- [ ] JSDoc comments on all props
- [ ] Storybook stories for all 6 variants
- [ ] Storybook stories for all 6 colors
- [ ] Storybook stories showing all combinations
- [ ] Storybook controls interactive
- [ ] Design token usage documented
- [ ] Usage examples in stories
- [ ] README.md in Button folder

#### Code Quality
- [ ] TypeScript strict mode passes
- [ ] No console errors or warnings
- [ ] ESLint passes
- [ ] Prettier formatted
- [ ] No TODO comments
- [ ] Proper prop destructuring
- [ ] Default props set appropriately
- [ ] Design token imports correct

### Examples
```tsx
// Basic button (defaults: solid, primary, medium, radius-medium)
<Button>Click me</Button>

// Primary solid button (explicit)
<Button variant="solid" color="primary">
  Primary Button
</Button>

// Bordered danger button, large size
<Button variant="bordered" color="danger" size="large">
  Delete
</Button>

// Light success button with small radius
<Button variant="light" color="success" radius="small">
  Success
</Button>

// Flat button with full radius (pill)
<Button variant="flat" radius="full">
  Cancel
</Button>

// Shadow variant with secondary color
<Button variant="shadow" color="secondary">
  Shadow Button
</Button>

// Ghost warning button
<Button variant="ghost" color="warning">
  Warning
</Button>

// Button with left icon
<Button icon={<SaveIcon />} iconPosition="left">
  Save
</Button>

// Icon only button
<Button icon={<SearchIcon />} ariaLabel="Search" />

// Loading button
<Button isLoading loadingText="Saving...">
  Save Changes
</Button>

// Disabled button
<Button isDisabled>
  Disabled
</Button>

// Small bordered button with right icon and large radius
<Button 
  variant="bordered"
  color="primary"
  size="small"
  radius="large"
  icon={<ArrowIcon />}
  iconPosition="right"
>
  Learn more
</Button>

// All color variants in solid
<Button color="default">Default</Button>
<Button color="primary">Primary</Button>
<Button color="secondary">Secondary</Button>
<Button color="success">Success</Button>
<Button color="warning">Warning</Button>
<Button color="danger">Danger</Button>

// All style variants with primary color
<Button variant="solid" color="primary">Solid</Button>
<Button variant="bordered" color="primary">Bordered</Button>
<Button variant="light" color="primary">Light</Button>
<Button variant="flat" color="primary">Flat</Button>
<Button variant="shadow" color="primary">Shadow</Button>
<Button variant="ghost" color="primary">Ghost</Button>
```

### Design Token Reference

The button component should import and use tokens from `design-tokens.css`:

**Colors**: `--color-{variant}-{shade}` (e.g., `--color-primary-500`)
**Foregrounds**: `--color-{variant}-foreground`
**Font Sizes**: `--font-size-{size}` (tiny, small, medium, large)
**Line Heights**: `--line-height-{size}`
**Radius**: `--radius-{size}` (small, medium, large)
**Border Width**: `--border-width-{size}` (small, medium, large)
**Box Shadow**: `--box-shadow-{size}` (small, medium, large)
**Opacity**: `--disabled-opacity`, `--hover-opacity`
**Focus**: `--color-focus`

### Notes
- All colors must use design token CSS variables
- No hardcoded color values allowed
- Ensure color contrast meets WCAG AA standards (4.5:1) using token foreground colors
- Test with keyboard navigation thoroughly
- Ensure focus states use `--color-focus` token
- Loading spinner should be smooth (CSS animation)
- Each color has 10 shades (50-900) - use appropriately for hover/active states
- Consider dark mode support in future (design tokens make this easier)
- Shadow variant should use appropriate box-shadow token based on button size

